    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers, or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\nSherry FitzGerald O'Reilly welcome you to 10 Beasley House, a spacious ground floor, 2 bedroomed apartment in Punchestown Gate. Punchestown Gate is a small, established development enjoying a prominent position just off the Dublin Road in Naas.\nPunchestown Gate is in a prime location, just a five-minute stroll from the heart of Naas, offering easy access to the town's many boutiques, restaurants, shops, sporting facilities and bars and amenities like the Naas hospital and theatre. Access to the M7 is just over 2 km away, and the commuter rail line in Sallins is less than 10 minutes drive.\nAccommodation in this superb apartment comprises - entrance hall, living/dining/kitchen, two double bedrooms and bathroom."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hallway - 3.61m x 2.6m\nAll rooms are accessed from the hallway. It is floored in an oak laminate and has both a hot press off and a large storage press (1.61m x 0.74m) with sockets.\n\nLiving/Dining Room - 6m x 3.44m\nThis is a bright and spacious room of dual aspect. It features a tile fireplace with wooden surround and a cast iron wood burning stove and is open to the kitchen.\n\nKitchen - 2.73m x 2.67m\nThe kitchen is fitted with a selection of shaker style cabinets and drawers with a tile splashback and tile floor. Included are a ceramic hob, oven, washer/dryer and integrated fridge freezer.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.97m x 3.45m\nThis generous double bedroom has been fitted with a range of Sliderobes. It has a carpet floor.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.57m x 2.36m\nThis is a double bedroom fitted with Sliderobe storage and a carpet floor.\n\nBathroom - 2.34m x 2m\nThe bathroom is tiled in large format porcelain tile. It comprises a wc, vanity, walk in shower unit with a Triton Touch shower, heated towel rail and an LED mirror.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Built circa 1989.</li><li>Extends to 62m2 approximately</li><li>Ground floor apartment.</li><li>Designated and visitor parking.</li><li>uPvc Double glazed windows.</li><li>Intercom system.</li><li>Well-maintained communal areas.</li><li>Electrical heating.</li><li>Curtains and light fittings included.</li><li>Listed kitchen appliances included.</li><li>Short stroll to the centre of Naas town with its array of shops, restaurants and sporting facilities.</li><li>Short drive to Junction 9 of the N7/M7 and the Arrow rail line in Sallins.</li><li>Bus stop for service to Dublin close by.</li><li>Management fees 1,836 per annum including refuse, grounds and communal areas maintenance, plus sinking fund.</ul>"
      },
      {
